# ENG HUB — what stays out of the repository
#
# Everything the program needs is committed, including the downloaded course
# material: it is all published openly by MEB and by the teachers who share on
# eltarena.com, and this project only brings it together in one place. Author
# names travel with every file (see the manifests).
#
# Only three things are left out:
#   1. files GitHub refuses (>100 MB) — they are attached to the Release instead
#   2. throwaway caches and logs
#   3. editor backups

# 1) too big for git — download from the Releases page if you want to rebuild
res/book.pdf
res/book_8.pdf
content/g5/u6/worksheets/01 5th Grade Theme 6 Worksheet Elif Nur.pdf

# Worksheets are online-only; keep their attributed link manifests.
content/**/worksheets/*
!content/**/worksheets/manifest.json

# 2) caches, logs, raw API dumps
tools/cache/
tools/logs/
tools/*.log
content/**/games/_raw.json

# 3) backups and python leftovers
content/**/presentation/*.bak
__pycache__/
*.pyc
